From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 14:56:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add cloud frontier-model connectors
 (OpenAI/Anthropic/Gemini/xAI/Azure) and SSE streaming chat

- CloudModelGateway routes provider-prefixed model names (openai:, anthropic:,
  gemini:, xai:, azure:) to configured providers; dark until API keys are set
  via config or conventional env vars. Local Ollama stays the default.
- POST /api/chat/stream emits SSE content deltas + terminal done event with
  full response metadata; Ollama called with stream:true (NDJSON), corpus
  fallback still streams when no model is reachable.
- AuricruxApiClient.SendChatStreamAsync + AuricruxService.ProcessQueryStreamAsync;
  Blazor chat renders assistant bubble incrementally with non-streaming retry.
- Fix conversation history: send chronological user/assistant pairs instead of
  assistant-only newest-first turns.
- Capabilities report updated with streaming + cloud connector rows.
- Tests: CloudModelGatewayTests (7), StreamingChatTests (4).
